{"product_id":"finding-sky-joss-stirling","title":"Finding Sky. Joss Stirling","description":"\u003cp\u003eYou have half our gifts, I have the other . . . When English girl Sky catches a glimpse of bad boy Zed in her new American high school, she can't get him out of her head. He talks to her with his thoughts. He reads her mind. He is the boy she will love for ever. Shadows stalk her past but a new evil threatens her future. She must face the dark even if it means losing her heart. Will Sky have the strength to embrace her power and be brave enough to control her own destiny, or will the demons of her past prevent her from realizing her true potential?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 143 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Joss Stirling\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780192792952\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 308\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45898400071833,"sku":"17RE-2-9780192792952","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691821a2e7a91_Finding_Sky._Joss_Stirling.jpg?v=1763202640","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/finding-sky-joss-stirling","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}